---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Commodore Amiga – Learn Programming Through Games"
  description="Learn Amiga programming by building complete games. Choose between AMOS BASIC for beginners or 68000 assembly for the full experience."
>
  <style>
    .system-hero {
      min-height: 350px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff6600 0%, #cc5200 100%);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .system-hero::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      background-image:
        repeating-linear-gradient(
          0deg,
          transparent,
          transparent 2px,
          rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1) 2px,
          rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1) 4px
        );
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .hero-content {
      text-align: center;
      color: white;
      padding: var(--space-8) var(--space-4);
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      max-width: 800px;
    }

    .system-title {
      font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
      text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    }

    .system-subtitle {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      opacity: 0.95;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    }

    .system-specs {
      display: flex;
      gap: var(--space-6);
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: var(--space-4);
    }

    .spec-item {
      text-align: center;
    }

    .spec-label {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      opacity: 0.8;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    .spec-value {
      font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .content-section {
      padding: var(--space-12) var(--space-4);
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
      color: var(--color-text);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .section-intro {
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
      max-width: 700px;
      text-align: center;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }

    /* Path Cards */
    .path-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(350px, 1fr));
      gap: var(--space-6);
      margin-top: var(--space-8);
    }

    .path-card {
      background: var(--color-surface);
      border: 2px solid var(--color-border);
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      padding: var(--space-8);
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--color-text);
      transition: all var(--transition-base);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .path-card:hover {
      border-color: #ff6600;
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(255, 102, 0, 0.2);
    }

    .path-card.recommended {
      border-color: #ff6600;
    }

    .path-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      padding: var(--space-1) var(--space-3);
      background: #ff6600;
      color: white;
      border-radius: 0.25rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
      align-self: flex-start;
    }

    .path-title {
      font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #ff6600;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
    }

    .path-subtitle {
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    }

    .path-description {
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
      flex-grow: 1;
    }

    .path-stats {
      display: flex;
      gap: var(--space-6);
      padding-top: var(--space-4);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    }

    .path-stat {
      text-align: center;
    }

    .stat-value {
      font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #ff6600;
    }

    .stat-label {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .path-cta {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-6);
      background: #ff6600;
      color: white;
      border-radius: 0.5rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-top: var(--space-4);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .path-card:not(.recommended) .path-cta {
      background: var(--color-surface);
      border: 2px solid #ff6600;
      color: #ff6600;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .path-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .system-specs {
        gap: var(--space-4);
      }
    }
  </style>

  <!-- System Hero -->
  <section class="system-hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <h1 class="system-title">COMMODORE AMIGA</h1>
      <p class="system-subtitle">Learn programming by building games</p>
      <div class="system-specs">
        <div class="spec-item">
          <div class="spec-label">CPU</div>
          <div class="spec-value">MC68000</div>
        </div>
        <div class="spec-item">
          <div class="spec-label">Speed</div>
          <div class="spec-value">7.16 MHz</div>
        </div>
        <div class="spec-item">
          <div class="spec-label">RAM</div>
          <div class="spec-value">512 KB+</div>
        </div>
        <div class="spec-item">
          <div class="spec-label">Graphics</div>
          <div class="spec-value">Agnus/Denise</div>
        </div>
        <div class="spec-item">
          <div class="spec-label">Sound</div>
          <div class="spec-value">Paula</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Choose Your Path -->
  <section class="content-section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Choose Your Path</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">
      Two ways to learn Amiga game development. Start with AMOS if you want quick results, or dive straight into 68000 assembly for the full experience.
    </p>

    <div class="path-grid">
      <a href="/commodore-amiga/assembly" class="path-card recommended">
        <span class="path-badge">Recommended</span>
        <h3 class="path-title">68000 Assembly</h3>
        <p class="path-subtitle">Full hardware control</p>
        <p class="path-description">
          Master the custom chipset: Copper for display magic, Blitter for fast graphics, and Paula for 4-channel sampled audio. This is how the best Amiga games were made.
        </p>
        <div class="path-stats">
          <div class="path-stat">
            <div class="stat-value">16</div>
            <div class="stat-label">Games</div>
          </div>
          <div class="path-stat">
            <div class="stat-value">1,920</div>
            <div class="stat-label">Units</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <span class="path-cta">Start Assembly Path</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/commodore-amiga/amos" class="path-card">
        <h3 class="path-title">AMOS BASIC</h3>
        <p class="path-subtitle">Gateway curriculum</p>
        <p class="path-description">
          Built-in sprite handling, BOBs, and sampled audio make impressive games achievable quickly. Build 8 complete games while understanding the custom chipset — then graduate to assembly.
        </p>
        <div class="path-stats">
          <div class="path-stat">
            <div class="stat-value">8</div>
            <div class="stat-label">Games</div>
          </div>
          <div class="path-stat">
            <div class="stat-value">512</div>
            <div class="stat-label">Units</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <span class="path-cta">Start AMOS Path</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
